  "content": "[Intro 1]\n[B5]\n\n[Intro 2]\n[B5]\n\n[Intro 3]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[E5]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[D5]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[E5]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[D5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[B5]Symbolical\nand mystical\nBetween life and death we're\ntorn\nA constant struggle\nLike an apocrypha\nNobody can be\ncertain\n[B5]A thousand days,\nspent in hell\nThe ultimate\nsacrifice\nYour voyage starts\nWith a question mark\nBut the distant future\nWill not tell\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[E5]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[D5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[E5]Bury [C5]me an [B5]an\ngel [E5]\n[E5]Set my [C5]black soul [B5]\n[D5]\n[Em]free\n[B/D#]\n[Em/D]\n[Em/C#]\n[Em]\n[B/D#]\n[Em/D]\n[Em/C#]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[B5]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[B5]Blackened chariots\nBearing evil souls\nRide the surface of\nburning holes\n[B5]Nocturnal\ntraveller\nYou represent the\nruined spirit\nSymbolical\nand mystical\nYou shall be\ndamned for all time\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[E5]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[D5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[E5]Bury [C5]me an [B5]an\ngel [E5]\n[E5]Set my [C5]black soul [B5]\n[D5]\n[Em]free\n[B/D#]\n[Em/D]\n[Em/C#]\n[Em]\n[B/D#]\n[Em/D]\n[Em/C#]\n\n[Bridge 1]\n[B5]\n[B5]\n\n[Bridge 2]\n[B5]\n[B5]\n\n[Bridge 3]\n[G]\n[F#]\n[Bm]\n[A]\n[G]\n[F#]\n[Bm]\n\n[Solo]\n[G]\n[F#]\n[Bm]\n[A]\n[G]\n[F#]\n[Bm]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[E5]\n[E5]  [C5]  [B5]\n[D5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[E5]Bury [C5]me an [B5]an\ngel [E5]\n[E5]Set my [C5]black soul [B5]\n[D5]\n[Em]free\n[B/D#]\n[Em/D]\n[Em/C#]\n\n[Outro]\n[Em]\n[B/D#]\n[Em/D]\n[Em/C#]",
